[b]Speculative Markets 1.1.4[/b]
[list]
[*]Banking now groups small boom loans under Other Goods, even when every holding falls below the chart cutoff.
[*]Market Mood shows how much carried over, how much came from this month's random swing, and how much company prosperity contributed.
[*]The Restrain tooltip explains how banks weigh a good when allocating new loans. All ten translations include the updated explanations.
[*]Small positive and negative pressure totals now display to two decimal places on the Finance and journal icons.
[*]If the country luring your capital disappears, its action clears from the Finance panel and another rival can act immediately.
[*]AI Exchanges now choose their highest-ranked eligible rival and drop an unscored opponent without charging a forfeit.
[*]Contest settlement now counts both sides' final pushes before clearing them for the next round. An Exchange with zero capital receives zero size points.
[/list]
